  "customfield_10154": null,
  "customfield_10187": null,
  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "The default triples from Fedora 5.1.0 for a binary are",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "<",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "http://localhost:8080/rest/binary1"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://localhost:8080/rest/binary1",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": ">",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "    rdf:type fedora:Binary ;",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "    rdf:type fedora:Resource ;",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "    fedora:lastModifiedBy \"bypassAdmin\" ;",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "    premis:hasSize \"17\"^^<",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#long"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#long",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": "> ;",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "    ebucore:hasMimeType \"text/plain\" ;",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "    fedora:createdBy \"bypassAdmin\" ;",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "    fedora:created \"2020-04-02T16:21:49.406Z\"^^<",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": "> ;",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "    fedora:lastModified \"2020-04-02T16:21:49.406Z\"^^<",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": "> ;",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "    premis:hasMessageDigest <urn:sha1:482cb0cfcbed6740a2bcb659c9ccc22a4d27b369> ;",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "    ebucore:filename \"\" ;",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "    rdf:type ldp:NonRDFSource ;",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "    iana:describedby <",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "http://localhost:8080/rest/binary1/fcr:metadata"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://localhost:8080/rest/binary1/fcr:metadata",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": "> ;",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "    fedora:hasFixityService <",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "http://localhost:8080/rest/binary1/fcr:fixity"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://localhost:8080/rest/binary1/fcr:fixity",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": "> .",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": " ",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Some of these triples probably are not needed or can be a different syntax.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "For example ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "type": "code"
        }
       ],
       "text": "iana:describedby",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": " is now a header and not needed. Also in Fedora 5 we had to restrict the updating of the {{ebucore:hasMimetype}} as it was necessary to allow us to serve the binary (",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "https://jira.duraspace.org/browse/FCREPO-2520)."
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "https://jira.duraspace.org/browse/FCREPO-2520).",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": " I would recommend that we store the incoming mimetype under a server managed property so user RDF changes don't need to be vetted and we can still serve the binary.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
   "type": "doc",
   "version": 1
  },
